{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WzDR9i-B9itk4EaRy3kILg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:42.401969+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WzDR9i-B9itk4EaRy3kILg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>清华大学深圳国际研究生院材料研究院将举办“2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营”，活动旨在增进国内高校学生对材料研究院的了解，扩展营员的学术视野，促进材料研究院导师和全国各高校优秀大学生之间的交流</span></p><p><span>本次活动以线下形式开展，开展时间为2025年7月2日-3日（暂定）。本夏令营主要活动包括研究院介绍、走进课题组、实验室参观、校园参观、师生互动交流等。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>01</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好、遵纪守法、身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2.全国高校本科在校生（2026年毕业）；已获得或将于2026年秋季学期开始前获得硕士学位学生。专业要求：材料、物理、化学化工、电子信息、能源、生物等相关专业。</span></p><p><span>3.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力。</span></p><p><span>4.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为。</span></p><p><span>5. 学习成绩优秀，其中本科生前5学期总评成绩在该校同年级本专业排名中名列前茅。</span></p><p><span>6. 外语水平须满足以下要求之一：</span></p><p><span>（1）大学英语四级或六级425分及以上；</span></p><p><span>（2）托福90分及以上；</span></p><p><span>（3）雅思（A类）6分及以上；</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（4）清华大学英语水平考试I各项成绩等级为5及以上。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名材料提交</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>02</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>报名问卷内需填写或提交的材料包括：</span></p><p><span>1.报名问卷（在线填写）；</span></p><p><span>2.在学证明（学生证）：本科生需提供本科学生证或在读证明；硕士生需提供硕士在读证明或硕士毕业证书、硕士学位证书；</span></p><p><span>3.个人自述：介绍本人专业背景、从事过的研究工作以及攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划等。意向报名直硕项目者1000字以内，直博和普博项目者3000字以内；</span></p><p><span>4.外语水平证明；</span></p><p><span>5.成绩单及排名证明：本科生需提供前5学期的各科成绩单原件和年级总评成绩排名（需盖学校或院系教务部门公章）；硕士生需提供本科及硕士研究生期间完整或最新日期学业成绩单（需盖学校或院系教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>6. 个人简历；</span></p><p><span>7. 其它材料：根据自身情况选择提交，包括获奖证书复印件（学术类相关奖项），能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物等；</span></p><p><span>8. 入营邀请函：有意向报名直博和普博项目的学生需自行联系意向博士生导师提供。</span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>注意：同一人不能重复报名硕士/博士两类项目。</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式及时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>03</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1．报名人通过问卷报名并按要求上传电子版材料，对应纸质版材料（一份）需在报名问卷开放期间寄达材料研究院，逾期将按照材料不全算作无效报名。所有报名材料恕不退还。</span></p><p><span>报名时间：5月23日9点-6月18日9点</span></p><p><span>报名链接： </span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/eGwIWQZrmOdZmCOGQ0vj2QlNKYIZ1iamqu2EPfMpXicEjKtn3FlaWxnMloshFDsNicdhxC3ibsNrNU9Ep1lgMGribzA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>https://vsxh18036q.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcneEkdnMlhpkyaML7o3K0SPg</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>纸质材料邮寄信息（</span><strong><span><span><span>邮寄顺丰，不接受到付</span></span></span></strong><span>）：</span></p><p><span>地址：深圳市南山区西丽大学城能源与环境大楼1311</span></p><p><span>收件人：冯老师</span></p><p><span>联系方式：0755-86954061</span></p><p><span>2. 入营通知：6月26日17点前。拟以邮件方式发送到报名时预留电子信箱，请保持邮件及手机畅通。未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>费用说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>04</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营为线下形式，入选营员需自行前往清华大学深圳国际研究生院。</span></p><p><span>本次夏令营不收取任何费用。入选营员交通自理。</span><span>材料研究院为营员购买意外保险。夏令营结束后材料研究院提供：在深的用餐补贴50元/人/天，并为外地营员发放住宿补贴150元/人/天，最高按照夏令营活动天数进行补贴。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究院、师资、项目介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>05</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>材料研究院师资与项目详情，请访问材料研究院官网。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/eGwIWQZrmOdZmCOGQ0vj2QlNKYIZ1iamqzJ34J5nWBLrn6BWMBRqekGTEwq3Yn57W59ib45g1gt0ZibrJlvEqDP6A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>https://www.sigs.tsinghua.edu.cn/934/list.htm</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>（一）硕士项目</span></p></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><span>专业代码</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>专业名称</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>项目名称</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>备注</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>085600</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>材料与化工</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>01功能材料与器件</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>—</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>0830J2</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>环境科学与新能源技术</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>01全球环境与新能源（材料方向）</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>全英文</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><section><p><span>（二）博士项目</span></p></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><span>专业代码</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>专业名称</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>备注</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>080500</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>材料科学与工程</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>—</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>0830J2</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>环境科学与新能源技术</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>全英文</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>06</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：冯老师</span></p><p><span>电话: 0755-86954061</span></p><p><span>邮箱: admissions.imr@sz.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>07</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.学生需保证全部报名材料的真实性，对在夏令营过程中存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，或存在其他严重影响过程和结果公平公正行为的，一经查实，将撤销相应资格。</span></p><p><span>2.如因不可抗力影响或上级部门出台新政策、安排或计划调整，导致夏令营工作安排或信息变化的，材料研究院将做相应调整，最终以材料研究院发布的相关通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e813a8f6b2d561b217bd2624d73df25a84ea8d2d9cf14a36e76014e8c506ae98","textLength":1780,"sourceSha256":"4cf953a27a50fe4f6ff172bf87739848f5f9426ba44673dac3ee0802d0344fc3","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c6b4d65872ee30896497","title":"2025年清华大学深圳国际研究生院2025年材料研究院优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:42.401969+00:00"}
